WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:04.000
(dramatic instrumental music)

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.230
- There's always like
limits you have to respect,

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:08.350
and whatever, especially
in the Middle East.

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:09.800
You can't be completely free.

00:00:22.727 --> 00:00:27.090
When I vogue, it's like
I'm expressing myself fully

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:29.260
without no restrictions whatsoever.

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:31.003
So I can just be me.

00:00:41.389 --> 00:00:45.330
I have a mini-zoo at
home; they're my babies.

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:47.810
I'm studying veterinary medicine,

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:49.863
but I also have, like,
this artistic side of me.

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:53.533
I'm the voguing fabulous
vet, let's say that.

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:01.840
Beirut is really so crazy 'cause there's

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:03.520
a lot of cultures going there,

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:05.793
a lot of politics, religions.

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:09.320
There's specific places in
Beirut, which are accepting,

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:11.970
but there's other places
in Beirut where you cannot

00:01:11.970 --> 00:01:14.823
be who you are, you might get attacked.

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:20.400
I try not to think of
that 'cause, you know,

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:23.090
it's just too problematic and I don't

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:24.420
have time for that to be honest.

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:26.390
I'm too busy building my life and

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:29.020
my career to think about politics.

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:31.220
Politics is bullshit
to me, I don't like it.

00:01:33.390 --> 00:01:35.080
Let's talk about voguing, honey.

00:01:35.080 --> 00:01:37.595
Let's talk about it.
(laughs)

00:01:37.595 --> 00:01:40.928
(slow electronic music)

00:01:44.150 --> 00:01:46.410
Voguing is a dance style that was created

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:48.416
by the LGBTQ people of color back

00:01:48.416 --> 00:01:50.363
in the '80s in New York City.

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:55.680
It was created as a safe
space for these people

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:57.900
to be themselves and express themselves

00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:00.160
without being judged by other people.

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:02.300
It's all sad, just like
practicing at home,

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:04.820
having fun and just learning over YouTube,

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:08.030
'cause you know there's no
voguers in Lebanon whatsoever.

00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:09.670
So practicing every single day

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:11.910
for like three hours in
my room or anywhere I can,

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:13.560
I would just practice everyday.

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:16.530
And then I start posting
videos on social media,

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:18.530
and I started growing bigger and bigger.

00:02:23.437 --> 00:02:25.590
I think it's something very me, and I love

00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:26.890
to teach it to people, and I would love

00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:28.697
to spread this culture to other people

00:02:28.697 --> 00:02:30.563
'cause it's a beautiful culture.

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:51.540
On Friday, I'm having a performance

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:53.010
in a club called Projekt.

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:57.330
So Projekt is like the
most accepting LGBTQ club,

00:02:57.330 --> 00:03:00.323
so, yeah, everyone goes there
just to have fun and be free.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:02.940
I've been preparing with my dancers

00:03:02.940 --> 00:03:04.170
and their outfits and everything.

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:06.743
So I'm panicking; I'm always panicking.

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:11.570
This club is fully crowded
every Friday, you have no idea.

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:13.380
And you have like
hundreds of people there,

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:16.940
so it's gonna be a big show,
it's gonna be really amazing.

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:18.420
People do not like feminine stuff,

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:19.860
especially like presumptive gay people.

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:22.360
They would prefer masculine
people 'cause their kind

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:25.240
of discreet and they think,
like, being feminine is

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:28.450
just having fun and
being silly or whatever.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:30.330
Voguing's such a culture,
which is very queer.

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:33.440
It's not straight at all, it's
not masculine as a culture.

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:34.690
It means a lot of hard work and

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:36.603
to show people it's something fun.

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:39.570
Once you're like fully dressed

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:43.960
with the makeup and everything,
it's just who you are.

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:46.200
It feels so great, you feel like,

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:47.040
oh, this is my moment to shine.

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:50.707
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:57.820
Dancing is ultimate freedom, it is life.

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:28.403
(audience cheering and applause)

00:04:32.088 --> 00:04:35.421
(slow electronic music)

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:41.480
Once I'm dancing, I'm charging

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:44.250
myself again to face the world.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.680
To me, it's not a problem being queer

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:48.780
or being different than anyone else.

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:51.333
I'm just me, and, take it or leave it.

